  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<b>Unleash Your Creativity</b><p></p>\n<p>Step into <b>Outside the Blocks</b>, the ultimate playground for builders and creators who want to express their artistic side in a relaxing, stress-free environment. Forget about objectives and pressure – immerse yourself in the pure joy of creation.</p>\n<p>Get ready to build, design, and explore your creativity like never before in <b>Outside the Blocks</b> – where the only limit is your imagination!</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Innovative Building Tools</b> – Craft stunning, one-of-a-kind structures with our unique modular architectural block system. Whether you’re a seasoned designer or a casual creator, our intuitive tools make building a breeze.\n</li><li><b>Dynamic Environment Tools</b> – Take your creations to the next level with powerful tools to shape your diorama’s world.\n</li><li><b>Show Off Your Masterpieces</b> – With a built-in Photo Mode you can easily capture and share your creations with friends and the community.\n</li></ul>\n",
